BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Balboa Footwork Bonanza (for both roles) with Natalia
DTSTART:20251115T154500Z
DTEND:20251115T164500Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Schoolplein 6\, 3581 PP Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Add rhythm\, texture\, and flair to your Balboa! This solo class will dive into fun footwork variations to elevate your (pure) Bal — to inspire your individual style and help you weave new rhythms seamlessly into your partnership. Open to all levels\, from beginner and up!
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/tcN19BmKkq1J1GSR8
UID:theme-class-saturday-balboa@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Hiphop with Alvaro
DTSTART:20251115T154500Z
DTEND:20251115T164500Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Cremerstraat 253\, 3532 BS Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Getting in to your groove and different layers of dancing
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/EiF3bQ4haTpKNsJu5
UID:theme-class-saturday-hiphop@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Traditional African Dance with John
DTSTART:20251115T154500Z
DTEND:20251115T164500Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Amsterdamsestraatweg 3\, 3513 AA Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:In this class\, John introduces you to the powerful energy of traditional dances\, focusing on hip and shoulder movements\, footwork\, expression\, collective dancing\, and joy. The dances originate from various East\, Central\, and Southern African countries.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/gEqX3444eLste4UP8
UID:theme-class-saturday-african@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - An Ode to Charleston with Tanja & Kay
DTSTART:20251115T154500Z
DTEND:20251115T164500Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Weerdsingel Westzijde 22\, 3514 AA Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Ah\, the humble Charleston: often taught\, but just as often forgotten. If all you can ever remember is Side-by-Side\, Hand-to-Hand\, and Tandem\, this taster is for you. We'll move beyond the basics and introduce some more interesting patterns to add a little flair. Our goal for this class is to convince you that interesting Charleston doesn't need to be hard.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/5xRC4nSW8u5DXdUy9
UID:theme-class-saturday-charleston@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Dance Fast\, Don’t Die - Solo Jazz with Mike
DTSTART:20251115T154500Z
DTEND:20251115T164500Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Van Imhoffstraat 2\, 3531 HW Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Learn the skills to enjoy the speedy high energy songs without feeling like you're running a race. Mike will show you how to keep it interesting and dynamic while dancing small and conserving energy\, then choose a moment to go big\, and bring the energy back down. Some of the most iconic and danceable jazz songs are fast, and if you're not comfortable dancing to them\, you are missing out!
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/5xRC4nSW8u5DXdUy9
UID:theme-class-saturday-solo@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT



BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Afro-Mix with John
DTSTART:20251116T160000Z
DTEND:20251116T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Oude Kerkstraat 2A\, 3572 TJ Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy John’s blend of traditional African and more modern dance styles such as hip-hop\, jazz\, and urban dance — all infused with the expressive energy of dancing together. We’ll make use of the entire floor\, with dynamic crossovers set to wonderful music.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/Uia1wPa9h7EtWhMQ8
UID:theme-class-sunday-african@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - HipHop with Alvaro
DTSTART:20251116T160000Z
DTEND:20251116T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Cremerstraat 253\, 3532 BS Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Getting in to your groove and different layers of dancing
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/EiF3bQ4haTpKNsJu5
UID:theme-class-sunday-hiphop@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Slow Bal Taster Class with Natalia & Mike
DTSTART:20251116T160000Z
DTEND:20251116T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Amsterdamsestraatweg 3\, 3513 AA Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Go from zero to Slow Bal hero! Learn Dean Raftery’s smooth\, flowing style with its signature “swimming” footwork and rotational dynamics. After this class\, every slow swing tune will be an invitation to enjoy the dreamy charm of Slow Bal. Open to all levels. Previous Balboa\, Blues, or Lindy Hop experience is recommended.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/gEqX3444eLste4UP8
UID:theme-class-sunday-slowbal@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Walking in Rhythm - Tap with Doortje
DTSTART:20251116T160000Z
DTEND:20251116T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Deken Roesstraat 2G\, 3581 RX Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:In this class we will work on the relationship between weight change and rhythm and combine the art of tap dancing with the art of casual walking. Expect to learn some cool tap moves that combine spectacle with nonchalance.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/T6iybCsY35UHuLAS7
UID:theme-class-sunday-tap@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - Dips & Tricks with Tanja & Kay
DTSTART:20251116T160000Z
DTEND:20251116T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20251030T221125
LOCATION:Pieterskerk\, Kromme Nieuwegracht 62\, 3512 HL Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:Solid basics are the bread and butter of our dancing\, but a diet of only bread and butter isn't exactly healthy. If you feel like your dancing is a bit too bland\, we'll make sure to add some spice to it in this taster. Starting with some embellishments and stylings that you can do with anyone\, we progressively work our way towards more demanding moves that require solid technique to pull off.
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/sYRmVfTc5Cw7BmJV9
UID:theme-class-sunday-lindyhop@swingdom2025
END:VEVENT
